                original: "Yeah, this is AI is genius. I didn't, I didn't do anything. AI is so genius.",
                fix: "Yeah, the AI is a genius. I didn't do anything.",
                fixWhy: `**☓this is AI is genius は be が2枚。**The AI is a genius。genius は名詞なので a が要る。**#10 / #14**`,
                alt: "That's all the AI. I can't take any credit.",
