                fixWhy: `**☓rugged car は「頑丈な車」。**ボロ車は beat-up / rundown。**#13、意味が反対。**☓take distance from は keep my distance from。**#12**。**☓don't put much care about は don't take care of。**☓if I were you, driving in your country は「もし私があなたなら、あなたの国で運転していて」で、仮定の主語が2重になった。**if I were driving in your country。`,
                alt: "You can be the safest driver on the road and still get taken out by the guy next to you. That's what scares me.",
