                role: 'student',
                original: "And, yeah, but once you are trying to, you know, learning a new language which is far apart from your original language, mother tongue, you realize, wow, it's very difficult. So, yeah, I think, yeah, yeah, and uh, sometimes occasionally, uh, I take, uh, Japanese, uh, English teachers, uh, they really understand and, well, well, you know, and what I'm trying to struggling, yeah, well it's, yeah, so that's, it's balance, you know. I take, like I try to strike a balance between, yeah, uh, English native and also Japanese amazing teachers on DMM. Yeah.",
