                role: 'student',
                original: "So, AI narrows the gap between rich and poor, which means less privilege and more opportunity. So, AI supports the financial stability of a household by putting expert advice in the hands of ordinary citizens, families, at your fingertips. And AI secures funding that doesn't run out because it lets uh uh consequently waste.",
