                role: 'student',
                original: "It's a lazy side of me. The very lazy sub-part of me appears. So that's why I put money into this DMM, and I'm always appreciative, because you're a very great teacher, and I have so many, maybe couples of, five great teachers. And they are not AIs, so I really count, and trust you guys.",
