                original: "With a defined microphone, your voice will be farther good, better than... We watched Joe Rogan Experience, right? Joe Rogan uses a top notch microphone. So we can hear without noise and we can immerse in the Joe Rogan Experience. Joe uses headphones, not necessarily required because the guest is in front of you.",
