                original: "So cocaine and heroin, everything is okay, everything is so, oh my, oh really?",
                fix: "So cocaine, heroin — everything? Really?",
                fixWhy: '驚きは短く。everything is okay を繰り返すより、名詞を並べて Really? で受けるほうが伝わる。',
                alt: "Hold on — all of it? Even the hard stuff?",
